## Grammar content

The 52 grammar concepts are written originally. Topic coverage and factual cross-checks used:

- **Wikibooks — German** (<https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/German>), CC BY-SA 3.0 / GFDL.
- **Wikipedia — German declension** (<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_declension>), CC BY-SA 4.0.
- **DeutschFokus German Learning Toolkit** (<https://github.com/DeutschFokus/german-learning-toolkit>), MIT.
- **Lingolia German Grammar** — used as a coverage checklist only; no text or tables copied.

